OL,3,GNEWSA'Nipple tattoos gave me my
OL,4,Aconfidence back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who received nipple tattoos
OL,7,Fafter having a double mastectomy said
OL,8,Fit has helped her regain her
OL,9,Fconfidence.
OL,11,FGrace Suffell, from Shropshire, was 25
OL,12,Fwhen she learned she had breast cancer
OL,13,Fand had to have the surgery to remove
OL,14,Fboth breasts, along with chemotherapy.
OL,16,FAfter the surgery, she discovered she
OL,17,Fcould have realistic nipples drawn back
OL,18,Fon by a specially-trained tattoo artist
OL,19,Fin Telford, which was fully-funded by
OL,20,Fthe Lingen Davies cancer support
OL,21,Fcharity.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
