OL,3,GNEWSA'Nipple tattoos gave me my
OL,4,Aconfidence back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "Going through it all knocks
OL,7,Fyour confidence, but as soon as I had
OL,8,Fit done, my mum said, 'Oh, you're
OL,9,Fstanding up straighter than what you
OL,10,Fwere before.'"
